<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>냥코 상점</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jua&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --navy-deep:#0c1638;
    --navy-panel:#141f4a;
    --navy-line:#2a3768;
    --gold:#f2b705;
    --gold-soft:#fddc7a;
    --tin-red:#d4302b;
    --tin-red-dark:#a6241f;
    --cream:#f4efe2;
    --cream-dim:#c9c4b4;
    --teal:#178a72;
    --ok:#4ade80;
    --err:#e0554f;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--navy-deep);color:var(--cream);font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
  .display{font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;}
  #shop-content{display:none;}

  /* ---------- GATE ---------- */
  .gate-screen{
    min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% -10%, rgba(242,183,5,.18), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 0%, rgba(212,48,43,.16), transparent 50%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #0a1230 0%, var(--navy-deep) 100%);
  }
  .gate-box{
    width:100%;max-width:380px;background:var(--navy-panel);border:1px solid var(--navy-line);
    border-radius:16px;padding:32px 26px;text-align:center;
  }
  .gate-icon{font-size:38px;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .gate-box h1{font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;font-size:24px;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--cream);}
  .gate-box p{font-size:13px;color:var(--cream-dim);margin:0 0 22px;line-height:1.6;}
  .gate-input{
    width:100%;padding:13px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--navy-line);
    background:var(--navy-deep);color:var(--cream);font-size:16px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:.06em;
    font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;
  }
  .gate-input:focus{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:1px;}
  .gate-error{color:var(--err);font-size:12.5px;margin-top:10px;min-height:16px;}
  .gate-btn{
    margin-top:14px;width:100%;padding:13px;border:none;border-radius:10px;background:var(--gold);
    color:var(--navy-deep);font-weight:900;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;
  }
  .gate-btn:disabled{background:#4a4f68;color:#8b8fa3;cursor:not-allowed;}
  .gate-admin-link{
    margin-top:20px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--cream-dim);opacity:.55;background:none;border:none;
    cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;
  }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;padding:48px 24px 36px;text-align:center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% -10%, rgba(242,183,5,.18), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 0%, rgba(212,48,43,.16), transparent 50%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #0a1230 0%, var(--navy-deep) 100%);
    border-bottom:3px solid var(--navy-line);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(1px 1px at 10% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,.5) 0, transparent 60%),
                       radial-gradient(1px 1px at 80% 30%, rgba(255,255,255,.4) 0, transparent 60%),
                       radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 60% 70%, rgba(255,255,255,.35) 0, transparent 60%),
                       radial-gradient(1px 1px at 30% 80%, rgba(255,255,255,.4) 0, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .hero-badge{
    display:inline-block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.02em;color:var(--navy-deep);
    background:var(--gold-soft);padding:4px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(32px,6vw,52px);margin:0 0 8px;
    color:var(--cream);text-shadow:0 3px 0 var(--tin-red-dark), 0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
    letter-spacing:.02em;
  }
  .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--cream-dim);font-size:15px;}
  .hero-notes{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px;}
  .hero-note{
    font-size:12.5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid var(--navy-line);
    padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--cream-dim);
  }
  .access-tag{
    position:absolute;top:14px;right:16px;font-size:11px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    border:1px solid var(--navy-line);padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--gold-soft);
  }

  /* ---------- LAYOUT ---------- */
  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 20px 60px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:28px;}
  @media (max-width:880px){.wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-bottom:200px;}}

  .cat-section{margin-bottom:34px;}
  .cat-header{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;padding-bottom:10px;
    border-bottom:2px solid var(--navy-line);
  }
  .cat-icon{
    width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .cat-title{font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;font-size:19px;color:var(--cream);}
  .cat-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--cream-dim);margin-left:auto;}

  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:12px;}

  .card{
    background:var(--navy-panel);border:1px solid var(--navy-line);border-radius:12px;
    padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;transition:border-color .15s, transform .15s;
  }
  .card:hover{border-color:var(--gold);}
  .card-name{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--cream);line-height:1.35;}
  .card-desc{font-size:12px;color:var(--cream-dim);flex-grow:1;}
  .card-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:4px;}
  .card-price{font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;font-size:17px;color:var(--gold-soft);}
  .add-btn{
    border:none;background:var(--tin-red);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;
    padding:7px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s, transform .1s;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .add-btn:hover{background:var(--tin-red-dark);}
  .add-btn:active{transform:scale(.95);}
  .add-btn.added{background:var(--ok);color:#0c1638;}

  .card.pkg{background:linear-gradient(160deg, var(--navy-panel), #1b2758);border-color:#3a4a8f;}
  .pkg-tier{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--gold-soft);font-weight:700;}
  .pkg-save{font-size:11px;color:var(--ok);font-weight:700;}
  .pkg-orig{font-size:11px;color:var(--cream-dim);text-decoration:line-through;}

  /* ---------- CART ---------- */
  .cart{
    position:sticky;top:20px;align-self:start;
    background:var(--navy-panel);border:1px solid var(--navy-line);border-radius:14px;
    padding:18px;max-height:calc(100vh - 40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  }
  .cart h2{font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--cream);}
  .cart-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--cream-dim);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .cart-items{overflow-y:auto;flex-grow:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;min-height:40px;}
  .cart-empty{font-size:13px;color:var(--cream-dim);text-align:center;padding:24px 0;}
  .cart-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;}
  .cart-item-name{flex-grow:1;line-height:1.3;}
  .qty-ctrl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:var(--navy-deep);border-radius:8px;padding:2px 6px;}
  .qty-ctrl button{background:none;border:none;color:var(--cream);font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;padding:2px 4px;}
  .qty-ctrl span{min-width:14px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;}
  .cart-item-price{width:64px;text-align:right;color:var(--gold-soft);font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;}
  .cart-remove{background:none;border:none;color:#e0554f;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;padding:0 2px;}

  .cart-total-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--navy-line);}
  .cart-total-label{font-size:13px;color:var(--cream-dim);}
  .cart-total-value{font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:var(--gold);}
  .min-order-warn{font-size:11.5px;color:#e0554f;margin-top:6px;}

  .checkout-btn{
    margin-top:14px;width:100%;border:none;border-radius:10px;padding:13px;
    background:var(--gold);color:var(--navy-deep);font-weight:900;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;
    font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.02em;transition:transform .1s, box-shadow .15s;
  }
  .checkout-btn:hover:not(:disabled){box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(242,183,5,.35);}
  .checkout-btn:active:not(:disabled){transform:scale(.98);}
  .checkout-btn:disabled{background:#4a4f68;color:#8b8fa3;cursor:not-allowed;}

  /* ---------- MODAL (checkout + admin share style) ---------- */
  .overlay{
    position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(6,10,26,.72);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    padding:20px;z-index:50;
  }
  .overlay.open{display:flex;}
  .modal{
    background:var(--navy-panel);border:1px solid var(--navy-line);border-radius:16px;
    width:100%;max-width:420px;padding:24px;max-height:90vh;overflow-y:auto;
  }
  .modal.wide{max-width:640px;}
  .modal h3{font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;font-size:19px;margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--cream);}
  .modal .modal-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--cream-dim);margin-bottom:18px;}
  .field{margin-bottom:14px;}
  .field label{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--cream-dim);margin-bottom:6px;}
  .field input, .field select{
    width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--navy-line);
    background:var(--navy-deep);color:var(--cream);font-size:13.5px;font-family:inherit;
  }
  .field input:focus, .field select:focus{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:1px;}
  .field-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;}
  .modal-summary{background:var(--navy-deep);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:12.5px;}
  .modal-summary-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:3px 0;color:var(--cream-dim);}
  .modal-summary-row.total{color:var(--gold-soft);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--navy-line);margin-top:6px;padding-top:8px;}
  .pay-methods{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px;}
  .pay-methods label{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--navy-line);border-radius:9px;
    padding:10px;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .pay-methods input[type=radio]{accent-color:var(--gold);}
  .pay-methods label.checked{border-color:var(--gold);background:rgba(242,183,5,.08);}
  .modal-btn-row{display:flex;gap:8px;}
  .modal-cancel{
    flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--navy-line);background:transparent;
    color:var(--cream-dim);font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-size:13.5px;
  }
  .modal-confirm{
    flex:2;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:none;background:var(--tin-red);color:#fff;
    font-weight:900;cursor:pointer;font-size:14.5px;font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;
  }
  .modal-confirm:disabled{background:#4a4f68;color:#8b8fa3;cursor:not-allowed;}

  .paying{text-align:center;padding:30px 10px;}
  .spinner{
    width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;border:4px solid var(--navy-line);border-top-color:var(--gold);
    margin:0 auto 16px;animation:spin .8s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
  .paying p{color:var(--cream-dim);font-size:13px;}

  .done{text-align:center;padding:12px 4px 4px;}
  .done-badge{
    width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ok);color:var(--navy-deep);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;margin:0 auto 14px;
  }
  .done h3{margin-bottom:4px;}
  .order-id{
    font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;font-size:20px;color:var(--gold-soft);background:var(--navy-deep);
    border-radius:9px;padding:10px;margin:14px 0;letter-spacing:.05em;
  }
  .done p.note{font-size:12px;color:var(--cream-dim);line-height:1.6;}
  .close-done{
    margin-top:16px;width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:none;background:var(--gold);
    color:var(--navy-deep);font-weight:900;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;font-size:14px;
  }

  .disclaimer{
    max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px 40px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--cream-dim);
    line-height:1.7;border-top:1px solid var(--navy-line);padding-top:18px;
  }

  /* ---------- ADMIN ---------- */
  .code-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;margin-top:6px;}
  .code-table th{text-align:left;color:var(--cream-dim);font-weight:600;padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--navy-line);font-size:11.5px;}
  .code-table td{padding:7px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);vertical-align:top;}
  .code-status{font-size:11px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;display:inline-block;}
  .status-active{background:rgba(74,222,128,.15);color:var(--ok);}
  .status-pending{background:rgba(242,183,5,.15);color:var(--gold-soft);}
  .status-expired{background:rgba(224,85,79,.15);color:var(--err);}
  .del-code{background:none;border:none;color:var(--err);cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;text-decoration:underline;}
  .gen-btn{background:var(--navy-deep);border:1px solid var(--navy-line);color:var(--cream);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;}
  .code-input-row{display:flex;gap:8px;}
  .admin-empty{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--cream-dim);padding:14px 0;text-align:center;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ================= GATE ================= -->
<div class="gate-screen" id="gate-screen">
  <div class="gate-box">
    <div class="gate-icon">🔒</div>
    <h1 class="display">입장 코드 확인</h1>
    <p>냥코 상점은 발급받은 기간제 코드로만 입장할 수 있어요.<br>보유하신 코드를 입력해 주세요.</p>
    <input type="text" id="gate-code-input" class="gate-input" placeholder="코드 입력" autocomplete="off">
    <div class="gate-error" id="gate-error"></div>
    <button class="gate-btn" id="gate-submit">입장하기</button>
    <button class="gate-admin-link" id="open-admin-login">관리자 로그인</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ================= SHOP ================= -->
<div id="shop-content">
  <div class="hero">
    <span class="access-tag" id="access-tag"></span>
    <span class="hero-badge">냥코 대전쟁 재화 &amp; 서비스</span>
    <h1 class="display">냥코 상점</h1>
    <p>필요한 것만 담아서 바로 주문하세요</p>
    <div class="hero-notes">
      <span class="hero-note">🐾 최소 주문 금액 200원</span>
      <span class="hero-note">🎁 2개 이상 구매 시 추가 할인</span>
      <span class="hero-note">🛡️ 빠른 작업 · 안전 거래 보장</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div id="catalog"></div>

    <aside class="cart">
      <h2 class="display">장바구니</h2>
      <div class="cart-sub" id="cart-count">담긴 상품 0개</div>
      <div class="cart-items" id="cart-items">
        <div class="cart-empty">아직 담은 상품이 없어요.<br>왼쪽에서 원하는 항목을 선택해 주세요.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cart-total-row">
        <span class="cart-total-label">총 결제금액</span>
        <span class="cart-total-value" id="cart-total">0원</span>
      </div>
      <div class="min-order-warn" id="min-warn" style="display:none;">최소 주문 금액(200원) 이상 담아주세요.</div>
      <button class="checkout-btn" id="checkout-btn" disabled>결제하기</button>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <div class="disclaimer">
    ※ 이 페이지는 주문 접수 및 결제 시뮬레이션 데모입니다. 실제 카드/간편결제 승인은 별도의 결제대행사(PG) 연동이 필요하며, 이 화면의 "결제하기"는 주문 내역을 정리해 판매자에게 접수하는 용도로 동작합니다.<br>
    입장 코드는 판매자가 지정한 기간 동안만 유효합니다.
  </div>
</div>

<!-- CHECKOUT MODAL -->
<div class="overlay" id="overlay">
  <div class="modal" id="modal-content"></div>
</div>

<!-- ADMIN LOGIN MODAL -->
<div class="overlay" id="admin-login-overlay">
  <div class="modal" id="admin-login-content">
    <h3 class="display">관리자 로그인</h3>
    <div class="modal-sub">코드 발급 및 관리를 위한 비밀번호를 입력하세요.</div>
    <div class="field">
      <label>관리자 비밀번호</label>
      <input type="password" id="admin-pass-input" placeholder="비밀번호">
    </div>
    <div class="gate-error" id="admin-login-error"></div>
    <div class="modal-btn-row">
      <button class="modal-cancel" id="admin-login-cancel">취소</button>
      <button class="modal-confirm" id="admin-login-submit">로그인</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ADMIN PANEL MODAL -->
<div class="overlay" id="admin-panel-overlay">
  <div class="modal wide" id="admin-panel-content"></div>
</div>

<script>
